suggestions:
Add robust JSON parsing with clear error handling to address the 'Expecting ',' delimiter' failure. Wrap json.loads(...) in try/except json.JSONDecodeError and print the exact line/column with a helpful message. Example:

try:
    data = json.loads(text)
except json.JSONDecodeError as e:
    print(f"JSON parse error at line {e.lineno}, column {e.colno}: {e.msg}", file=sys.stderr)
    sys.exit(1)
